{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-022",
    "title": "借火修行"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_118",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“因为你每次借火，都会把一部分记忆交给它。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "归墟灵城崩塌后的第三天，三方来使同时抵达旧驿道。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3649,
          "end": 3649
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临和顾长离暂住在一座废弃的石亭里。两枚残印被包在不同的布袋中，分别放在石亭两端。只要其中一枚靠近另一枚，掌心青痕便会发冷，仿佛提醒他不要让两扇门在同一处打开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3651,
          "end": 3651
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜坐在亭外修补地图。灵城崩塌后，他肩上多了一道剑伤，却不肯使用疗伤符。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3653,
          "end": 3653
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们归墟盟为什么没有派人追来？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3655,
          "end": 3655
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“派了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3657,
          "end": 3657
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我没看见。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3659,
          "end": 3659
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为他们在等谁先找到我们。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3661,
          "end": 3661
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "话音刚落，旧驿道东侧传来剑鸣。三名玄霄宗修士踏着石路而来，为首者穿灰袍，腰间悬着一块白玉令牌。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3663,
          "end": 3663
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“奉玄霄宗长老令，带陆照临回山。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3665,
          "end": 3665
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜站起：“他不是你们的囚犯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3667,
          "end": 3667
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士看他：“归墟盟私闯宗门、诱拐弟子，已列入追责名单。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3669,
          "end": 3669
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们先把自己的失踪记录解释清楚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3671,
          "end": 3671
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士没有接话，转向陆照临：“你父亲陆沉舟曾受宗门雇佣。如今你持有宗门遗失之物，玄霄宗愿以护山令保你安全。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3673,
          "end": 3673
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“条件？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3675,
          "end": 3675
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“交还两枚残印，回宗接受问询。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3677,
          "end": 3677
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冷笑：“问询之后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3679,
          "end": 3679
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由长老裁定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3681,
          "end": 3681
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临问：“如果我拒绝？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3683,
          "end": 3683
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士抬手，三名弟子同时拔剑：“那便按盗取宗门禁物处置。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3685,
          "end": 3685
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "旧驿道上忽然落下一片白叶。白叶触地即化，露出叶脉组成的无相寺印记。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3687,
          "end": 3687
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一名灰衣僧人从西侧林中走出，正是慧闻。他手里没有铜镜，只提着一串木珠。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3689,
          "end": 3689
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗的护山令，护不住被删去的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3691,
          "end": 3691
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士皱眉：“无相寺也要插手？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3693,
          "end": 3693
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我们只想带他去看一面镜子。”慧闻说，“看完之后，残印归谁，由他自己决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3695,
          "end": 3695
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们无相寺从不干涉世事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3697,
          "end": 3697
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆不是世事，是每个人的根。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3699,
          "end": 3699
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在旁边笑了：“说得好听。你们想要的是他记忆里的太虚坐标。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3701,
          "end": 3701
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看向他：“归墟盟想要的也不只是坐标。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3703,
          "end": 3703
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“至少我们承认想要改写权。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3705,
          "end": 3705
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三方在旧驿道中央对峙。陆照临握住两只布袋，感到残印的寒意沿手臂上升。他想起灵城石厅里的三条未来：点灯、毁印、带离。每一条都没有安全的结局。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3707,
          "end": 3707
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗能告诉我陆沉舟现在在哪里吗？”他问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3709,
          "end": 3709
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士答：“灵城崩塌后，所有人都在寻找他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3711,
          "end": 3711
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括你们？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3713,
          "end": 3713
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3715,
          "end": 3715
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你们为什么说他是失踪的引灯人，不是被太虚遗脉承载的人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3717,
          "end": 3717
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3719,
          "end": 3719
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜把修补好的地图递给陆照临：“跟我走，去归墟盟总坛。那里有三百年前的原始盟约。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3721,
          "end": 3721
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻说：“跟我走，去无相寺。那里有完整的旧灾证词。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3723,
          "end": 3723
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士最后开口：“跟我回玄霄宗。只有宗门知道天门何时会再次开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3725,
          "end": 3725
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三份条件摆在陆照临面前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3727,
          "end": 3727
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟提供路线，无相寺提供记忆，玄霄宗提供时间。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3729,
          "end": 3729
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到他身边：“你可以谁都不选。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3731,
          "end": 3731
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我们去哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3733,
          "end": 3733
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“去找第三盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3735,
          "end": 3735
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她从袖中取出一张新抄的账页。账页上写着：第三盏灯未入灵城，最后一次记录在北境雪原。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3737,
          "end": 3737
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向灰袍修士：“玄霄宗知道雪原上的灯吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3739,
          "end": 3739
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟？”他问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3767,
          "end": 3767
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "人影没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3769,
          "end": 3769
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青光里传出另一个声音：“金丹之前，不可开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3771,
          "end": 3771
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“借来的火，能留下多少已经算多。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3931,
          "end": 3931
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "洞外剑光划过雪幕。玄霄宗弟子开始破阵，铜线一根根崩断。白灯仍悬在岩洞中，火焰没有受到影响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3933,
          "end": 3933
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向它：“如果我点亮白灯，会怎样？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3935,
          "end": 3935
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会打开一道门。”慧闻的声音从洞外传来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3937,
          "end": 3937
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人回头。灰衣僧人站在雪中，木珠缠在手腕，脚边没有脚印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3939,
          "end": 3939
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜皱眉：“你怎么找到我们的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3941,
          "end": 3941
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我没有找你们，是你们的记忆带我来的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3943,
          "end": 3943
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻走进岩洞，抬头看白灯：“这不是第三盏灯，是门的影子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3945,
          "end": 3945
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯在哪里？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3947,
          "end": 3947
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“在你不愿记起的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3949,
          "end": 3949
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“又是这句话。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3951,
          "end": 3951
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为你每次借火，都会把一部分记忆交给它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3953,
          "end": 3953
        }
      }
    ],
